  <jpcrp_cor:FootnotesDirectorsAndCorporateAuditorsTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant_Row1Member">&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:47.6pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-40.5pt;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13.0pt;"&gt;(注) １  取締役樋口英雄、香川進吾及び久保雅子は社外取締役であります。&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:FootnotesDirectorsAndCorporateAuditorsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:FootnotesDirectorsAndCorporateAuditorsTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant_Row2Member">&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:49.6pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-18.8pt;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13.0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;２　監査役村中徹及び山田昌吾は社外監査役であります。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:FootnotesDirectorsAndCorporateAuditorsTextBlock>
